$CATEGORY: Q18 - Array of Objects 

::Q1801::
encode - To represent one set of values using another set of values by constructing a mapping between them. {TRUE}

::Q1802:: 
A variable declared within a class as static. There is only one copy, no matter how many objects there are. {
    = class variable
    ~ instance variable
}

::Q1803::
An attribute of an object; a non-static variable defined at the class level. {
    = instance variable
    ~ class variable
}

::Q1804::
An algorithm that searches array elements, one by one, until a target value is found. {
    = sequential search
    ~ binary search
}

::Q1805::
An algorithm that searches a sorted array by starting in the middle, comparing an element to the target, and eliminating half of the remaining elements. {
    = binary search
    ~ sequential search
}
